msgid "JOURNAL_LEFT"
msgstr "Lucas thinks he can force his way through everything with a wrench.\n\nHe doesn't get that this old junction box follows a sequence. Remember our secret code for catching the night train, Juli?"

msgid "JOURNAL_RIGHT"
msgstr "First, you light the track.\nThen, you punch the ticket.\nFinally, you blow the signal."

msgid "ITEM_RAILWAY_LANTERN_DESCRIPTION"
